  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABIf I Were a Carpenter - 2006 Remaster\xBB
    y \xABKilling the Blues\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xAB29 Palms - 2006 Remaster\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABBig Log - 2006 Remaster\xBB y \xABIn
    the Mood - 2006 Remaster\xBB."
